  "units": [
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u1",
      "position": 1,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "💻 面了百度健康的 Go 后端岗位，面试官全程“拷打式提问”，从短链系统到点赞设计，再到微服务与 Http/GRPC，全程技术满点！\n来给大家还原这场面试 👇",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 1
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u2",
      "position": 2,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "🎯 面试问题倾向\n整理下来，主要分三大类：\n① 系统设计 & 数据结构\n* 短链接是如何实现的？\n* 点赞数以及点赞用户如何设计？\n* 表结构如何设计？什么时候写入、生成短链、分发？\n* 项目整体流程展开讲解\n👉 倾向点：考察你能否 从需求到落地完整思路清晰地讲清楚，尤其是高并发场景下的设计。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 2
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u3",
      "position": 3,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "* DNS 原理，域名如何解析成 IP？\n* Http 流程详解\n* Http 与 GRPC 的区别\n* 服务 A 如何找到服务 B？服务注册是怎么做的？\n👉 倾向点：关注 微服务间调用、协议理解与线上可行性**，面试官喜欢结合项目讲场景。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 3
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u4",
      "position": 4,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "③ 算法 & 并发\n* 算法题：使用三个协程交替打印 1\\~100\n👉 倾向点：考察 Go 协程、channel、并发控制思维，不仅仅是写代码，还要讲逻辑。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 4
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u5",
      "position": 5,
      "source_unit_type": "outcome-reflection-summary",
      "text_projection": "📝 我的总结 & 反思\n*短链设计：一开始只说了哈希生成短链，没有讲到写入数据库、缓存和映射回长链的完整流程，下次要梳理清楚 写入→暴露→映射→分发。\n点赞系统：答得简单，没提高并发下的缓存更新策略和幂等性，面试官很看重性能优化。\nDNS/Http/GRPC：流程答对了，但讲得太流水账，没有结合微服务场景说明调用逻辑。\n算法题：代码能写，但没讲时间复杂度和协程间同步机制。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 5
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u6",
      "position": 6,
      "source_unit_type": "narrative-summary",
      "text_projection": "⚡ 注意点（面后心得）",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 6
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u7",
      "position": 7,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "1. 系统设计要完整：短链、点赞系统不仅写出来，更要讲清楚 流程、缓存、并发控制。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 7
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u8",
      "position": 8,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "2. 协议与微服务结合场景：Http/GRPC、服务发现、注册中心，一定要能口头复述流程。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 8
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u9",
      "position": 9,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "3. 并发算法要讲思路：面试官更看重你 协程逻辑清晰、channel 控制合理，而不是光写出结果。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 9
      },
      "fragments": []
    },
    {
      "source_unit_id": "xhs:68b2aa77000000001d03aa47:snapshot-95b77bb26104:note-desc-12:u10",
      "position": 10,
      "source_unit_type": "question-like",
      "text_projection": "4. 项目经验要贴实战：高并发、性能优化、服务调用场景，都能加分。",
      "source_provenance": {
        "source_projection_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_desc/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.txt@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "source_projection_sha256": "30636dfacafa1e43738382d9da624c8562447fdbbb6fbea60224260a0fb8ca7c",
        "raw_artifact_ref": "liqiangcc/xhs:note_detail/68b2aa77000000001d03aa47.html@95b77bb261048059846273688e4b90a2e108b437",
        "raw_sha256": "3535b2c05d7dd09daff0da7111ded3ea9177e5a670559f5f980bc920b564e9dd",
        "source_projection_item_number": 10
